== Verb ==
{{verb2|do|does|did|done|doing}}
# {{third-person singular of|do}}
#: ''Who '''does''' the [[wash]]ing up? Daddy does.''
#: ''Annie '''does''' her homework in the afternoon.''

== Noun ==
{{noun|doe}}
# {{plural of|doe}} A [[female]] [[deer]].
#: ''We saw three '''does''' at the [[zoo]].''

{{wikipedia}}

=== Pronunciation ===
* {{US}} {{enPR|rān'bō|rām'bō}}, {{IPA|/ˈreɪnboʊ/|/ˈreɪmboʊ/}}
* {{UK}} {{IPA|/ˈreɪnbəʊ/}}
* {{audio|en-us-rainbow.ogg|US}}

== Noun ==
{{noun}}
[[File:Sofia rainbow.jpg|thumb|A rainbow]]
# {{countable}} A '''rainbow''' is an [[arch]] of [[color]]s in the [[sky]] that you can see in the [[rain]] when the [[sun]] is at your [[back]].
#: ''Traditionally, the colors of the '''rainbow''' are [[red]], [[orange]], [[yellow]], [[green]], [[blue]], [[indigo]] and [[violet]], but in real life, it's actually a continuous [[spectrum]].''

{{clear}}
== Adjective ==
{{adjective}}
# When something is '''rainbow''', it is made up of many colors.

== Verb ==
{{verb}}
# {{transitive}} When you '''rainbow''' something, you make it into something that has many colors, just like a [[#Noun|rainbow]].

[[Category:Weather]]

