== Verb == {{verb3|be|am|is|are|was|were|been|being}} {| border=0 width=100% |- |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| '''Negatives:''' | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| None, '''[[isn't]], [[aren't]]''' | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| '''[[wasn't]], [[weren't]]''' | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| None | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| None |} {| border=0 width=100% |- |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| '''Contractions:''' | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| '''[['m]], [['s]], [['re]]''' | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| None | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| None | width=0.5% | |bgcolor="#e2e2ff" valign=top width=20% style="padding-left:1em;"| None |} # {{Auxiliary}} {{linking verb}} A form of the [[verb]] ''[[be]]'' used about the person speaking #: ''I '''am''' hungry. Is there any food around?'' #: '''''Am''' I right?''
