=== Usage notes === * The preposition ''per'' is usually followed by a singular noun phrase with no [[determiner]]. *: ''Take one pill '''per''' day,'' not ''*Take one pill '''per''' a day,'' and not ''*Take one pill '''per''' days.'' * It is sometimes followed by plural noun phrases, almost always after numbers such as ''100, 1,000, 100,00,'' etc. *: ''The rate has dropped from nearly 30 '''per''' 1,000 women of childbearing age, to less than 2.''
