== Noun == {{noun}} {{AVL}} # {{cu noun}} A '''concern''' about something means something that a person is [[worried]] about. #: ''The government expressed its '''concern''' at the fighting in Kenya.'' #: ''Poor sales are causing '''concern''' among the owners.'' #: ''Our main '''concern''' now is to make sure that everyone is safe.'' #: ''There is widespread '''concern''' about the approaching storm.'' #: ''He '''concern''' for her children is understandable, given the lack of information.'' #: ''The changes at the school were quite clearly a matter of great interest and '''concern''' among students.'' # {{uncountable}} A '''concern''' with something means something that a person is [[interested]] in or [[involved]] with. # {{uncountable}} '''Concern''' is a feeling that a person wants to help someone. #: ''Her look of '''concern''' made him feel better.'' # {{countable}} A '''concern''' is a business. #: ''XYZ Company is an ongoing '''concern''', and we have no plans to shut it down.''
