== Noun == {{noun}} # {{uncountable}} '''Recall''' is your [[ability]] to think about something you learned or experienced in the past. #: ''You can improve your '''recall''' by using [[memory]] tricks.'' # {{countable}} A '''recall''' is a request to stores and customers to send back a product because it has a problem. #: ''The company is announcing the '''recall''' of fifteen different [[product]]s.''
