A template for creating a well-formatted link to IRC channels on the Freenode network.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{irc|<channelname>}}
</pre>
The first parameter is the channel you wish to link to (and will also be the text displayed). Defaults to #wiktionary-simple (the IRC channel of this wiki).

== TemplateData ==
{{TemplateDataHeader}}
<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"required": false,
			"label": "Channel name",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "The name of the channel to link to."
		}
	},
	"description": "A template for generating a nice link to IRC channels on the Freenode network."
}
</templatedata>

