<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template is used for adding a strikethrough if the page exists, or displays a normal red link if it doesn't.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{autostrike
| 1 = Page title
| 2 = Link name
}}
</pre>
Note: As this template uses the parser function <code><nowiki>{{#ifexists:</nowiki></code>, this template has to be used sparingly as this parser function is considered to be resource-intensive on the server.

== Examples ==
;Existing page:
<code><nowiki>{{autostrike|Main Page}}</nowiki></code> &rarr; {{autostrike|Main Page}}

;Non-existant page:
<code><nowiki>{{autostrike|Non-existent page}}</nowiki></code> &rarr; {{autostrike|Non-existent page}}

