{{high-use|10,000+}}
This template is used as a part of speech header for [[noun]]s.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{noun
| 1 = Singular term
| 2 = Plural term
| 3 = Second plural term
}}
</pre>

== Examples ==
;Standard nouns
For nouns that just add "s" in the plural, add <code><nowiki>{{noun}}</nowiki></code> to the page to make:
{{noun}}

;Nouns with different plurals from the standard
For other nouns, use <code><nowiki>{{noun|leaf|leaves}}</nowiki></code> to make:
{{noun|leaf|leaves}}

;Nouns with the same singular and plural
For nouns where the plural is the same as the singular, use <code><nowiki>{{noun|moose|moose}}</nowiki></code> to make:
{{noun|moose|moose}}

;Nouns with two different plurals
For nouns with two different plurals, use <code><nowiki>{{noun|index|indexes|indices}}</nowiki></code> to make:
{{noun|index|indexes|indices}}

;Nouns with no plurals
For nouns with no plural, use <code><nowiki>{{noun|steel|none}}</nowiki></code> to make:
{{noun|steel|none}}

;Nouns with no singulars
For nouns with no singular, use <code><nowiki>{{noun2}}</nowiki></code> to make:
{{noun2}}

