{{documentation subpage}}
<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template is used for adding audio files to pages, with the [[International Phonetic Alphabet|IPA]] notation.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{Audio-IPA
| 1 = Name of sound file
| 2 = IPA notation
}}
</pre>

== Examples ==
<code><nowiki>{{Audio-IPA|En-petrification.ogg|/ˌpetɹɪfɪˈkeɪʃən/}}</nowiki></code> gives this:

:{{Audio-IPA|En-petrification.ogg|/ˌpetɹɪfɪˈkeɪʃən/}}

== TemplateData ==
{{TemplateDataHeader}}
<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"required": true,
			"label": "Audio file",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "The audio file."
		},
		"2": {
			"required": true,
			"label": "IPA notation",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "The IPA notation for the audio file."
		}
	},
	"description": "Template for adding audio files to pages, with the IPA notation."
}
</templatedata>

== See also ==
* [[Template:audio]], a version without [[International Phonetic Alphabet|IPA]] notation.

