{{documentation subpage}}
<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template is used for giving other users on the wiki a [[Wiktionary:Barnstar|barnstar]] in [[recognition]] of their work.

Note: This template is to be substituted on the user's talk page!

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{Barnstar
| 1 = Message to the user
| name = Name of the barnstar
| img = The image to use for the barnstar
| color = The background color of the barnstar
}}
</pre>
You can find more barnstars at [[:en:w:WP:BARN]] and at [[commons:Category:Barnstars]]. For example, to award the Editor's Barnstar, you can use: <code><nowiki>{{subst:Barnstar|</nowiki>''Message''<nowiki>|img=Barnstar2.png}}</nowiki></code>

== TemplateData ==
{{TemplateDataHeader}}
<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"required": false,
			"label": "Message",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "The message you would like to give the user."
		},
		"color": {
			"required": false,
			"label": "Background color",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "The background color for the barnstar."
		},
		"img": {
			"required": false,
			"label": "Image",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "The image to use for the barnstar."
		},
		"name": {
			"required": false,
			"label": "Name of barnstar",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "The name of the barnstar you are giving."
		}
	},
	"description": "Template for awarding other users on the wiki a barnstar in recognition of their work."
}
</templatedata>

