{{documentation subpage}}
<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template lists the [[antonym]]s of a definition.

== Usage ==
Use this template at the end of a definition to list one or more [[antonym]]s (up to 50).

For example, this: <pre># Definition. &#x7B;&#x7B;synonyms|foo&#x7D;&#x7D; &#x7B;&#x7B;antonyms|bar|baz&#x7D;&#x7D;</pre> produces this: <ol><li>Definition. {{synonyms|foo}} {{antonyms|bar|baz}}</li></ol>

== Technical details ==
* The show/hide toggling is enabled by the "Hidden 'Onyms" code in [[MediaWiki:Common.js]].

