This template is a userbox to display the edit counts of a user. The number of edits made by the user is manually added to the first parameter, and various different colors will be displayed depending on the number.

== Usage ==
For general usage:
<pre>
{{User editcount
| 1 = Number of edits
}}
</pre>
It is recommended to [[round off]] the number of edits to the nearest [[hundred]] or [[thousand]], since it is not practical to keep updating it with an exact value.

There are more information about other parameters given in [[#TemplateData|the TemplateData]] section below.

