This template adds a user box showing that you are an [[Wiktionary:Administrators|administrator]] of Wiktionary.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{User administrator
| 1 = Name of project
| RFA = Link to successful RFA
| lang_code = Interwiki prefix (if {{{1}}} is set)
| username = Your user name (defaults to the name of the user page without the "User:" prefix)
}}
</pre>
This template can also be used in <code><nowiki>{{#babel}}</nowiki></code>. Use <code><nowiki>{{#babel:administrator}}</nowiki></code> will give you:
{{Babel|administrator|align=left}}
