<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template is used to easily create chemical formulas.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{chem
| link = Page to link to for the given formula
| 1 = Atomic symbol(s)
| 2 = Number in subscript
}}
</pre>
This template can accept up to 20 parameters (10 atomic symbols and 10 subscript numbers). All other parameters are optional.

== Example ==
<code><nowiki>{{chem|link=sulfuric acid|H|2|SO|4}}</nowiki></code> gives you:

{{chem|link=sulfuric acid|H|2|SO|4}}

