<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template is used to add a box listing all the shortcuts available for the page, usually used on project pages.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{shortcut
| 1 = List of shortcuts
}}
</pre>
There may be more than one shortcut available for a page. In that case, use the tag <code><nowiki><br></nowiki></code> to separate them.

== Example ==
<code><nowiki>{{shortcut|[[WT:A]]<br>[[WT:ADMIN]]<br>[[WT:SYSOP]]<br>[[WT:MOP]]}}</nowiki></code> gives you:
<div style="float:left">
{{shortcut|[[WT:A]]<br />[[WT:ADMIN]]<br />[[WT:SYSOP]]<br />[[WT:MOP]]}}
</div>
{{clear}}

== TemplateData ==
{{TemplateDataHeader}}
<templatedata>
