<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template links to Wiktionary editions in other [[:Category:Languages|languages]] and is placed on those definition pages.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{interwiktionary
| 1 = Interwiki code (language code)
| 2 = Alternative name for the language
}}
</pre>
Instead of ''(interwiki code)'' you will type the 2 letter code for a language. The code is the same as what is used in interwiki listings. 

For example, if you want to link to the German Wiktionary, you would type
<pre>{{interwiktionary|de}}</pre>

A helpful listing of each language's code can be found [[:m:Wiktionary#List of Wiktionaries|here]].

