=== Pronunciation ===
* {{IPA|/kən.ˈkluːd/}}
* {{audio|en-us-conclude.ogg|US}}

== Verb ==
{{verb|conclud|e}}
{{AVL}}
# When something '''concludes''', you come to an [[end]] of it. {{ant|begin|start|initiate}}
#: ''After giving a story of himself, the speaker '''concluded''' with an inspiring quote.''
# When you '''conclude''' something, you come to the end of it and to [[finish]] it.
#: ''After many hours in the [[meeting]], I '''concluded''' it.''
# When you '''conclude''', you make a [[conclusion]] or a [[decision]].
#: ''After living in this city for some time, I '''conclude''' that the people here are quite warm and friendly.''
#: ''After studying the [[evidence]]s, the [[investigator]] '''concluded''' that the man was [[murder]]ed''

