== Noun ==
{{noun}}
[[File:Agrafeuse Sunset Mallat n°825 02.jpg|thumb|A '''staple''' used for fastening papers]]
# A '''staple''' is a very [[basic]] and [[important]] [[supply]] of something.
#: ''Rice is an important '''staple''' in many Asian countries.''
# A '''staple''' is a [[tool]] used to fasten stacks of paper [[secure]]ly together.
