== Verb ==
{{verb|stapl|e}}
# {{transitive}} When you '''staple''' something, you sort it according to its [[#Noun|staple]].
#: ''The [[cotton]] was '''stapled''' according to it's [[quality]].''
# {{transitive}} When you '''staple''' paper, you secure it with a [[#Noun|staple]].

