This template is used to show that a request has not been completed. This template is mainly used on discussion pages

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{not done
| 1 = Text to display after the check mark
}}
</pre>

== Examples ==
For example:

Can someone delete this page? --[[Main Page|Joe]] ([[Wiktionary:Simple talk|talk]]) {{CURRENTTIME}}, {{CURRENTDAY}} {{CURRENTMONTHNAME}} {{CURRENTYEAR}} (UTC)
:{{not done}}, this page should not be deleted. --[[Main Page|John]] ([[Wiktionary:Simple talk|talk]]) {{CURRENTTIME}}, {{CURRENTDAY}} {{CURRENTMONTHNAME}} {{CURRENTYEAR}} (UTC)

