{{wikipedia}}
=== Pronunciation ===
* {{UK}} {{IPA|/kɒn.dəˈmɪn.ɪ.əm/}}
* {{US}} {{IPA|/kɑn.dəˈmɪn.i.əm/}}
* {{audio|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-condominium.wav|UK}}
* {{hyph|con|do|min|i|um}}

== Noun ==
{{noun}}
[[File:Condos and the Singapore Flyer by the Kallang River.jpg|thumb|A '''condominium''' in Singapore]]
# {{countable}} A '''condominium''' is a [[colony]] that is jointly ruled by two nations.
#: ''New Hebridges was a '''condominium''' of the [[United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland]] and [[France]]''
#: ''Anglo-Egyptian Sudan was a '''condominium''' of the United Kingdom and [[Egypt]].''
# {{US}} {{CA}} A '''condominium''' is where a person has their own [[housing unit]] but its {{r|facilit|ies}} are shared with other people living in the same [[estate]].

{{Commons category|Condominiums}}

[[Category:Housing]]

