== Adjective ==
{{adj|more=true}}
# When something is '''populous''', it means that there is a large [[population]].
#: ''China is the most '''populous''' [[country]] in the world.''
# When a [[language]] is '''populous''', it is spoken by many people.
# A '''populous''' place is a place where many people live in it, a place that is [[dense]]ly populated.

[[Category:Terms suffixed with -ous]]

=== Word parts === {{ety-suffix|forceful|ly}}
== Adverb == {{adv|more=true}} # When you do something '''forcefully''', you do it in a [[powerful]] and [[forceful]] manner. #: ''The [[dictator]] [[execute]]d all his [[opponent]]s '''forcefully'''.''
[[Category:Adverbs suffixed with -ly]]

=== Pronunciation ===
* {{IPA|/ˈɛksɪˌkjuːt/}}
