{{substnotice}}
This template is used to give a notice to a user that a page that they have created has been quickly deleted on Wiktionary.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{subst:QD-notice
| page = The page that was quickly deleted
| reason = The reason for the quick deletion
| cat = The category of quick deletion
}}
</pre>

This template should be substituted on the respective user talk page, while adding a signature just after that. For example:

<pre>{{subst:QD-notice}} --~~~~</pre>

== TemplateData ==
{{TemplateDataHeader}}
<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"page": {
			"label": "Page title",
			"description": "The page that has been quickly deleted.",
			"example": "Main Page",
			"type": "wiki-page-name",
			"required": true
		},
		"reason": {
			"label": "Reason",
			"description": "The reason as to why the page was quickly deleted.",
			"type": "string"
		},
		"cat": {
			"label": "Deletion category",
			"description": "The category of quick deletion, required if a reason was provided.",
			"example": "G1",
			"type": "string"
		}
	},
	"description": "Template for giving a notice to users that a page that they have created has been quickly deleted on Wiktionary."
}
</templatedata>

