<!-- Categories, interwikis and TemplateData go at the bottom of this page. -->
This template gives a short summary at the top of [[Wiktionary:Rules|rule]] pages. It is put below the title and other infoboxes and above the first paragraph of the rule description.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{nutshell
| 1 = Text to put in the first bullet
| 2 = Text to put in the second bullet
| 3 = Text to put in the third bullet
}}
</pre>

{{Template_notes
|Use the nutshell summary to make Wiktionary more inviting to new users
|Nutshell entries must be short overviews, without extra information
|Make sure each word in the nutshell has a lot of meaning
|Wikilink important words to other [[Wiktionary:Rules|rule]] pages to make a "nut trail"}}

