== Noun ==
{{noun}}
# {{countable}} A '''rogue''' is an [[unprincipled]], [[unreliable]], and [[deceitful]] person. They do not listen to [[authority]] and do not follow [[rule]]s or [[law]]s.
# {{context|role-playing games}} A common [[class]] in role-playing games is the '''rogue''', a class all about [[stealth]] and [[stealing]].

[[Category:People]]

== Adverb ==
{{adverb|more=true}}
# When something is done '''negligently''', it means that the person doing it is [[neglect]]ing something that he is supposed to be doing or neglecting another person's needs.

